17-12.967 12.967-12.967 12.967 5.817 12.967 12.967-5.817 12.967-12.967 12.967z\"></path></svg>"}]}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GPS.jpg","alt":"","bg":true},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"GPS &amp; POSITIONING SOLUTIONS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Precision Navigation for Autonomous Systems"},{"t":"p","html":"Modern autonomous platforms rely on accurate positioning to navigate safely, execute complex missions, and operate reliably in dynamic environments. GPS and GNSS positioning systems provide the location intelligence required for stable flight, autonomous navigation, mapping, surveying, and precision control across UAVs, robotics, and industrial applications.<br><br>TechnoAI offers a comprehensive portfolio of GNSS receivers, RTK positioning systems, antennas, and navigation modules that integrate seamlessly with professional flight controllers and autonomous platforms, enabling reliable performance from research and prototyping through to commercial deployment."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"BENEFITS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Key Benefits"},{"t":"ul","items":["High-accuracy positioning","Multi-constellation satellite support","RTK centimetre-level precision","Reliable autonomous navigation","Fast satellite acquisition","Open platform compatibility","Rugged, mission-ready hardware","Scalable for commercial and industrial use"],"ordered":false},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"GPS &amp; RTK Portfolio"},{"t":"p","html":"Our positioning portfolio includes standard GNSS receivers, RTK modules, high-performance antennas, compass modules, and navigation accessories designed for UAVs, robotics, and autonomous systems."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"APPLICATIONS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Ideal For"},{"t":"icon","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 512 512\" xml:space